\;\\forall y\\in C\\;\\exists z\\in C\\;(x\\subseteq z\\land y\\subseteq z)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}directed\\text{-}class} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectedClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land C\\neq\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in C\\;\\exists z\\in C\\;(x\\subseteq z\\land y\\subseteq z)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Directedness is with respect to inclusion and includes the standard nonemptiness requirement.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Class}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-class.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectedClass}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}directed\\text{-}class} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectedClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land C\\neq\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in C\\;\\exists z\\in C\\;(x\\subseteq z\\land y\\subseteq z)","display":true}],"bytes":835,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1856","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-directed-class.md|58-df-zfc-directed-class]]（